	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>S<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Nuper per <persName ref="p1283">Gessnerum</persName> vestrum annotata tua in confessionem <persName>F[arelli]</persName> et <persName ref="p8033">B[ezae]</persName>remisi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Nunc per hunc exploratę fidei virum et compatrem hunc meum, vestratem quidem, sed <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nostrum civem, epistolas etiam mitto, pro quibus magnam tibi gratiam habeo.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Colloquium iam antea satis sciebam non hunc in modum processurum, quemadmodum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nonnulli somniabant.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Dominus ipse princeps pacis ecclesię suę impeditissimas <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>rationes quam primum ad nominis sui gloriam feliciter expediat.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Saluta tuam domum meę nomine cum sanctissimis fratribus et amicis; <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>salutant te nostri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Fac, sciam, quid a vestris contra istos, qui militatum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>secundo et tertio abierunt, constitutum sit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sero hos abituros rescivi, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>quamquam nihil prorsum novi accepimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Die gmeinen knecht und ettlich <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>grosß <persName>Hansen</persName> füren vyl und groß guͦt hie durch, das zuͦ <placeName>Calles</placeName> geroubt <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>und ussbeutet worden.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Sed propediem, scio, revoment, quę tam crudeli <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>voracitate in stomachum pessime coquentem traiecerunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Ach, wie suhr wirt sy das speyen ankommen und inen das hertz abstossen!</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Datum in grosser yl den 10. martii anno 1558.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Fuerunt hic nobiles <placeName ref="l93">Clivenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>adulescentes, qui affirmant <lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p3375">Petrum P(aulum) Vergerium</persName> defectionem <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>rursum a nostris ad pontificios <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>meditari; sed Christus meliora cum illo!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Von der Adresse nur "<placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>" erhalten.]</note>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
